        "raw": "<p>Just thought I&#39;d share this with you all. I know GTG had some con-exclusive Sentinels button set, which was great and I thought was neat. But it wasn&#39;t enough for me.</p><p>So I had my own made, with some extras!</p><p>These are the first 11 in a set of what I&#39;m planning on being a set of buttons for every hero! And maybe some villains. I would have made Chrono-Ranger (because he&#39;s so cool), but his character art has only been posted with the text surrounding it, so it wouldn&#39;t have worked. I&#39;ll just have to wait until they post his character card art with just the art and no card text.</p><p>The best part? This whole set of 1.25&#39; buttons was $18.19 from Zazzle.com. That includes shipping. What a deal, right?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n![buttons.jpg|960x717](upload://16vL6D33Q9B7DtwYudtyGBhmxRe.jpeg)",
